摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"plugin for dsh deep diving","id":"gh:1340775138","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-deep-diving","slug":"skymecode/dsh-deep-diving","topics":["dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"plugin for dsh deep diving"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-deep-dive-skins"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"中文 · Releases"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"An animated blue whale maid for the DeepSeek Harness Web GUI's **Deep diving…**\nstatus row. She thin"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"ks, runs, builds a snowman and more, changing actions\nthroughout the same turn. Four vector skins re"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"s a snowman and more, changing actions\nthroughout the same turn. Four vector skins remain available."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## Preview"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"Real sprite frames, not a browser screenshot. Run `pnpm preview` for a live\npreview with the **relea"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"se bundle and actual settings card** over a simulated\nHost scope. Start/end a turn, change settings "},{"id":"p6s3","text":"and test plugin unloading there."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"- Default `whale-maid`: eight transparent, 100-frame animations, 10fps each.\n- Continuous rotation w"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"ithin one turn: think → run → snow → wave → code →\nbubbles → dance → idle. Default interval: 10 seco"},{"id":"p8s3","text":"nds (adjustable to 60).\n- Turn rotation off to loop one action. `random` changes the skin at each\nin"},{"id":"p8s4","text":"terval without repeating the previous skin.\n- Existing `whale`, `dafeiyu`, `catgirl`, and `mermaid` "},{"id":"p8s5","text":"vector skins retained.\n- Live settings: enable/disable, skin, size (14–96px), first action, rotation"},{"id":"p8s6","text":",\ninterval and optional localized status text.\n- Handles both `Deep diving...` and the current Chine"},{"id":"p8s7","text":"se `深度求索中...` row.\n- Reduced motion stops animation/rotation; hidden tabs pause. Turn completion\nand"},{"id":"p8s8","text":" unloading clean up timers, observers, listeners and changed text.\n- Reuses dsh-pet's working-whale "},{"id":"p8s9","text":"marker to avoid stacked ornaments, restoring\ndisplaced ornaments on disable. No Harness source patch"},{"id":"p8s10","text":" or pet server needed.\n- Sprites are bundled locally: no runtime requests to GitHub/CDNs."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## Install / upgrade"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"Install the GitHub Release tarball (npm publication is not required):"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"Use your own profile name if it is not `web`. Restart `dsh web` and refresh the\npage after upgrading"},{"id":"p12s2","text":". Existing settings are preserved: choose **Blue whale\nmaid**, enable **Continuous rotation**, and s"},{"id":"p12s3","text":"et **48–64px** if you previously\nsaved a vector skin or a smaller size."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Development install:"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"## Compatibility"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"Current SDK/type-check baseline: official\n`dsh-v0.1.5-rc.2`,\nthe newest release checked on 2026-09-1"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"3. Peer ranges accept the `0.1.5`\nalpha/RC line, including `0.1.5-rc.1` (the npm `latest` channel at"},{"id":"p16s3","text":" that time),\nand retain `0.1.3-alpha.2`, `0.1.2-rc.1`, `0.1.1-rc.2`, `0.1.1-rc.1`,\n`0.1.0-rc.8` and "},{"id":"p16s4","text":"and retain `0.1.3-alpha.2`, `0.1.2-rc.1`, `0.1.1-rc.2`, `0.1.1-rc.1`,\n`0.1.0-rc.8` and `0.1.0-rc.7`."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"- Settings cards register using `key: 'deep-dive-skins'` on\n`settings.plugin.item`; no list-slot `id"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"`/`order`.\n- No dependency on the removed `dsh-client-runtime` browser module or the\nremoved host `i"},{"id":"p17s3","text":"nstallSettingsSection` / `settingsNamespace` exports.\n- Host registers through `ctx.settings.registe"},{"id":"p17s4","text":"r`; the client uses the shared\nscope `set`/`unset` contract with read-back. It does not confuse lega"},{"id":"p17s5","text":"cy\n`{field}` batch operations with modern `{path}` operations.\n- Uses `settingsScope` normally, with"},{"id":"p17s6","text":" the legacy `webUiSettings` binder when\ninstalled. Existing settings continue to work; new fields ha"},{"id":"p17s7","text":"`webUiSettings` binder when\ninstalled. Existing settings continue to work; new fields have defaults."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"Automated checks exercise the built factory, both binder contracts, the real\nReact form, current SDK"},{"id":"p18s2","text":" host registration and DOM lifecycle. The 28 unit tests\nalso check the installed SDK version, the tu"},{"id":"p18s3","text":"rn's one-second elapsed-clock\nupdates and conversation switching. Host registration/unload was reche"},{"id":"p18s4","text":"cked\nwith the published 0.1.1-rc.2 provider module."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"The release-bundle preview is browser-tested with Tabbit (simulated Host\nstorage), including animati"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"on, settings and lifecycle behavior. This is not\na full end-to-end conversation test on every histor"},{"id":"p19s3","text":"ical Harness version."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## Settings"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"| Field | Values / default |"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"| Enable plugin | On |\n| Skin | `whale-maid` / `whale` / `dafeiyu` / `catgirl` / `mermaid` / `random"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"` |\n| Ornament size | 14–96px, default 48 |\n| Starting action | `think` / `run` / `snow` / `wave` / "},{"id":"p22s3","text":"`code` / `bubbles` / `dance` / `idle` |\n| Continuous rotation | On; off still loops the selected ani"},{"id":"p22s4","text":"mation |\n| Rotation interval | 10–60 seconds, default 10 |\n| Replace status text | Off; when on, fol"},{"id":"p22s5","text":"lows the UI language |"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## Development"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"`scripts/import-whale-maid.mjs` reproduces sprites from pinned upstream videos\n(requires ffmpeg with"},{"id":"p25s2","text":" libvpx-vp9 and PNG support; existing outputs are skipped).\n`node scripts/build-asset-preview.mjs` r"},{"id":"p25s3","text":"egenerates the frame contact sheet.\nSprites use CSS `steps(100)` and a single rotation timer per mou"},{"id":"p25s4","text":"nted plugin.\nThe ~4MB browser factory includes all eight sprites to work with old and new\nloaders wi"},{"id":"p25s5","text":"thout static-asset URL assumptions."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"## Asset source and licenses"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"The matching blue-haired whale-maid animations were found in\n`PC2005-cloud/dsh-pet`\nand converted fr"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"om transparent VP9 videos into compact WebP sprite strips.\nNo user-uploaded screenshot is distribute"},{"id":"p27s3","text":"P9 videos into compact WebP sprite strips.\nNo user-uploaded screenshot is distributed in the plugin."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"**Important: upstream assets allow open-source use but prohibit commercial\nuse.** This restriction a"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"pplies to the bundled whale-maid images and embedded\ncopies; they are **not Apache-2.0 assets**. See"},{"id":"p28s3","text":"\nasset attribution and terms and contact the\nupstream author for commercial permission."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"Plugin code is Apache-2.0. Vendored build/card files retain their dsh-web-ui\nprovenance; see file he"},{"id":"p29s2","text":"che-2.0. Vendored build/card files retain their dsh-web-ui\nprovenance; see file headers and LICENSE."}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
